      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]When soft [C7]the dews [F]of kindly sleep",
        "[C]My weary eyelids gently steep,",
        "[D7]Be [Gm]my [C]last thought [F]how [Gm7]sweet [C]to rest",
        "[Bb][Csus]Forever [C]on [Dm][Bb]my [C7]Savior's [F]breast!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Abide with [C7]me from [F]morn till eve,",
        "[C]For without Thee I cannot live;",
        "[D7]Abide [Gm]with [C]me [F]when [Gm7]night [C]is nigh,",
        "[Bb]For [Csus]without [C]Thee [Dm]I [Bb]dare [C7]not [F]die."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Be near [C7]and bless me [F]when I wake,",
        "[C]Ere through the world my way I take;",
        "[D7]Till [Gm]in [C]the [F]ocean [Gm7]of [C]Thy love",
        "[Bb][Csus]I [C]lose [Dm]myself [Bb]in [C7]heaven [F]above."
      ]
